000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     SDSCTRNS.
000400 AUTHOR.         ANNETTE M. KRAUSS.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JANUARY 1986.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700 INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*C***********************************************************
001000*C  S D S C T R N S    DESCRIPTION TRANSLATION SUBPROGRAM   *
001100*C                                                          *
001200*C  THIS SUBPROGRAM IS CALLED BY :                          *
001300*C       1) SCODEUPD - CODE UPDATE SUBPROGRAM               *
001400*C                                                          *
001500*C   THIS SUBPROGRAM CALLS:                                 *
001600*C       1) CCODECHK - CODE CHECK SUBPROGRAM                *
001700*C       2) TBLOWUP  - BLOWUP SUBPROGRAM                    *
001800*C       3) TSCRPRT2 - SCREEN PRINT SUBPROGRAM              *
001900*C       4) CRFMTKWM - REFORMAT KEYWORD/MODIFIER SUBPROGRAM *
002000*C                                                          *
002100*C  THIS SUBPROGRAM PROVIDES A USER WITH THE ABILITY TO     *
002200*C  VIEW (AND POSSIBLY UPDATE) THE DESCRIPTION TEXT         *
002300*C  ASSOCIATED WITH A STORES CODE IN EACH OF TWO LANGUAGES  *
002400*C  (STORED IN THE DATASETS DDESC AND DDESC2).              *
002500*C                                                          *
002600*C  THE ONLY RESTRICTION IMPOSED IS THAT THE AMERICAN       *
002700*C  LANGUAGE (CORPORATE) DESCRIPTION TEXT ASSOCIATED WITH   *
002800*C  A CORPORATE CODE CANNOT BE UPDATED.  THIS MUST BE DONE  *
002900*C  WITHIN THE IBM ENVIRONMENT, WITH THE CHANGES BEING      *
003000*C  DOWNLOADED AND THE DATA BASE UPDATED PROGRAMATICALLY.   *
003100*C                                                          *
003200*C***********************************************************
003300*C                                                          *
003400*C PROGRAM CHANGES:                                         *
003500*C                                                          *
003600*C   05/05/86  ADDED EDIT CHECKS IN ORDER TO ALLOW THE      *
003700*C             USER TO TRANSLATE/MODIFY THE KWM.  THE ONLY  *
003800*C             RESTRICTIONS ARE THAT THE KWM MUST EXIST IN  *
003900*C             MKEYADJ AND THAT THE AMERICAN LANGUAGE KWM   *
004000*C             ASSOCIATED WITH A CORPORATE CODE CANNOT BE   *
004100*C             MODIFIED.                A. M. KRAUSS        *
004200*C                                                          *
004300*C   09/05/86  REVISED THE DESCRIPTION MODIFY ROUTINES TO   *
004400*C             BEGIN PUTTING DESCRIPTION TEXT INTO ID-NUM   *
004500*C             "09" RATHER THAN "01".  THIS CHANGE WILL     *
004600*C             MAKE ALL PROGRAMS WHICH ADD DESCRIPTION TO   *
004700*C             DDESC AND/OR DDESC2 CONSISTENT.  ID NUMBERS  *
004800*C             "01" THRU "08" ARE NOT BEING USED BY ANY     *
004900*C             PROGRAM AT THIS TIME.                        *
005000*C                                 D.A. PLUM.               *
005100*C                                                          *
      *C  09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C             EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C             RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  07MAY1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C             DISABLED THE CALL TO PROGRAM SMULTDBS SINCE
      *C             THIS PROGRAM DOES NOT EXIST ON THE AS/400.
      *C             ALSO DISABLED THE ASSOCIATED "F1" LOGIC WHICH
      *C             LEADS TO THE CALL TO SMULTDBS.
      *C
      *C             ALSO ADDED "INVALID KEY" PHRASES TO SEVERAL
      *C             I-O OPERATIONS TO ELIMINATE THESE ERRORS IN
      *C             THE COMPILED PROGRAM LISTING.
      *C
005200*C***********************************************************
005400
005500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
005800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DCODE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3402
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC2
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDSCMAIN-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MALTKEY
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MKEYADJ-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
005900
006000 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DCODE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCODE-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3400 OF MCFLCS3402.

       FD  DDESC
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1400 OF MCFLCS1401.

       FD  DDESC2
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC2-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3100 OF MCFLCS3101.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                            PIC X(2000).

       FD  MALTKEY
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS MALTKEY-REC.
       01  MALTKEY-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS3001.

       FD  MKEYADJ-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS MKEYADJ-REC-I.
       01  MKEYADJ-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS3301.

       FD  MSTORERM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS MSTORERM-REC-I.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.

