069900        UNTIL (SDESC2-INDEX IS GREATER THAN 15)
                 OR (COND-WORD = 15).
070100
070200     IF SDESC2-INDEX IS GREATER THAN 8
070300         MOVE "YES" TO IF-MORE-DDESC2.
070400
070500
070600 631-GET-DDESC2.
