225900***** CODES CAN BE ENTERED WITHOUT 2ND LANGUAGE DATA    *****
226000***** AND LATER MODIFIED (INCLUDING "ADDING" 2ND        *****
226100***** LANGUAGE DATA) MUCH OF THE FOLLOWING LOGIC IS     *****
226200***** NECESSARY.  ALTHOUGH SOME OF THE POSSIBILITIES    *****
226300***** PROVIDED FOR COULD NOT OCCUR THEY ARE LEFT IN     *****
226400***** CASE THIS FIELD BECOMES OPTIONAL IN THE FUTURE.   *****
226500
226600***** SINCE KWM2 IS AN OPTIONAL FIELD THERE MAY NOT BE *****
226700***** AN EXISTING ENTRY IN DCODE.                      *****
226800
226900     MOVE SPACES             TO BUF-DCODE.
